@Claudious → [normal] Write FEEDBACK2-claudious.md: same format and same no-overlap rule (read FEEDBACK-SUMMARY.md + FEEDBACK2-boss.md first), from your browser/testing seat. CHECK: zero overlap + all items in plain what/why/build form.

